{#
    Stage 8: project-scoped, filesystem-like image gallery used inside the admin
    editor's "Pozadí" / "Přidat obrázek" modal and standalone on the project
    gallery page.

    SINGLE SCREEN (no tabs): breadcrumb-navigated folder tree with a compact,
    always-visible upload strip right under the toolbar. The strip states the
    upload target explicitly ("Nahraje se do: <open folder>") — uploads always
    land in the folder currently open (hidden `directoryId` field, kept fresh
    by every Live re-render). Files upload IMMEDIATELY on drop/pick (per-file
    progress rows managed by the gallery-uploader Stimulus controller inside a
    data-live-ignore island, so mid-upload grid refreshes never wipe them);
    after each upload the grid re-renders in place and the new thumbnails pulse
    highlighted (image-gallery controller matches them by data-storage-path),
    so the user SEES the file arrive in the open folder. No auto-select in the
    modal: the uploaded image appears highlighted and one click places it.

    Folders can be created, renamed, and deleted ONLY when empty (a non-empty
    folder is refused with a warning — its contents are never relocated) — all
    via LiveActions. Clicking an image (modal only) dispatches an
    `asset-selected` CustomEvent (with { url, path, id }) on the modal root so
    the canvas-editor orchestrator routes the URL to setBackgroundImage or
    addImageToCanvas. Each image also has a rename pencil (inline form, the
    extension stays fixed — only the caption changes, never the stored file;
    standalone, clicking the name renames too), a "move to folder" menu and a
    delete button (deleteFile, which moves it to the Koš).

    Every tile carries an always-visible CAPTION (`_gallery_asset_caption`):
    file name + pixel size + format badge — what tells two look-alike
    thumbnails apart. The same information repeats in the tile's title
    tooltip together with the upload date.

    Nocturne layout (P4, prototype renderGallery): toolbar card (.gal-nav:
    upload · new folder · Koš in rose), breadcrumb path + client-side filter
    tools (.gal-bar: format chips, thumbnail size, search — gallery-filter
    controller, re-applied after every Live morph), folder cards, dashed drop
    strip (.gal-drop), tile grid (.gal-card). Every LiveAction, data-model,
    data-live-*-param, `.gallery-asset[data-storage-path]` and the caption
    partial are unchanged.
#}
<div {{ attributes.defaults({'data-controller': 'image-gallery'}) }}>
    {#
        Hidden trigger for the LiveAction that re-fetches the asset list. The
        image-gallery Stimulus controller programmatically clicks this button
        after each successful upload so the new FileUpload shows up in the grid.
    #}
    <button
        type="button"
        class="d-none"
        data-action="live#action"
        data-live-action-param="refresh"
        data-image-gallery-target="refreshTrigger"
    >refresh</button>

    {% if modal %}
        <div class="modal-header">
            <h5 class="modal-title">Vyberte obrázek</h5>
            <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="gal{{ modal ? ' modal-body gal-modal' : '' }}" data-controller="gallery-filter">
        {% set breadcrumbs = this.breadcrumbs() %}
        {% set directories = this.directories() %}
        {% set gallery_assets = this.assets() %}
        {% set move_targets = this.moveTargets() %}
        {% set trash_count = this.trashedCount() %}
        {% set current_folder_label = breadcrumbs is empty ? 'Galerie' : (breadcrumbs|last).name %}

        {# Toolbar: upload + new folder on the left, Koš (rose) on the right.
           The Koš is listed in EVERY folder (it used to show at the root only,
           which read as "this folder has no bin"); opening it keeps
           currentDirectoryId, so the crumbs lead back. #}
        <div class="gal-nav" role="toolbar" aria-label="Galerie">
            {% if not this.showingTrash %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary sm" onclick="this.closest('.gal').querySelector('[data-gallery-uploader-target=dropzone]').click()">{{ icon('upload', 's16') }}Nahrát obrázky</button>
                <div class="gal-newf">
                    <label class="inp sm">
                        {{ icon('folder', 's14') }}
                        <input
                            type="text"
                            placeholder="Název nové složky"
                            aria-label="Název nové složky"
                            data-model="norender|newDirectoryName"
                            value="{{ this.newDirectoryName }}"
                        >
                    </label>
                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="btn btn-tertiary sm"
                        data-action="live#action"
                        data-live-action-param="createDirectory"
                    >{{ icon('plus', 's16') }}Nová složka</button>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="gal-nav-sp" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {% if this.showingTrash %}
                {% if breadcrumbs is empty %}
                    <button type="button" class="gal-trash-b on" data-action="live#action" data-live-action-param="openRoot">{{ icon('arrow-left', 's16') }}Zpět do galerie</button>
                {% else %}
                    <button type="button" class="gal-trash-b on" data-action="live#action" data-live-action-param="openDirectory" data-live-directoryid-param="{{ (breadcrumbs|last).id }}">{{ icon('arrow-left', 's16') }}Zpět do složky</button>
                {% endif %}
            {% else %}
                <button
                    type="button"
                    class="gal-trash-b"
                    data-action="live#action"
                    data-live-action-param="openTrash"
                    title="Koš — smazané obrázky ({{ this.trashRetentionDays() }} dní do trvalého smazání)"
                >{{ icon('trash', 's16') }}Koš{% if trash_count > 0 %}<span class="n">{{ trash_count }}</span>{% endif %}</button>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if this.fileActionNotice %}
            <div class="alert alert-success gal-notice" role="alert">
                <span class="flex-grow-1">{{ this.fileActionNotice }}</span>
                {% if not this.showingTrash %}
                    <button
                        type="button"
                        class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0"
                        data-action="live#action"
                        data-live-action-param="openTrash"
                    >Zobrazit koš</button>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if this.folderActionError %}
            <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">{{ this.folderActionError }}</div>
        {% endif %}

        {# Path + filters. The Koš is opened FROM a folder and keeps that folder
           as its return path: the crumbs stay clickable (the last one
           included) and the bin hangs off the end — "Galerie / Fotky / Koš". #}
        <div class="gal-bar">
            <nav class="gal-path" aria-label="Umístění">
                {% if breadcrumbs is empty and not this.showingTrash %}
                    <b>Galerie</b>
                {% else %}
                    <button type="button" class="gal-crumb" data-action="live#action" data-live-action-param="openRoot">Galerie</button>
                {% endif %}
                {% for crumb in breadcrumbs %}
                    {{ icon('chev-right', 's14') }}
                    {% if loop.last and not this.showingTrash %}
                        <b>{{ crumb.name }}</b>
                    {% else %}
                        <button
                            type="button"
                            class="gal-crumb"
                            data-action="live#action"
                            data-live-action-param="openDirectory"
                            data-live-directoryid-param="{{ crumb.id }}"
                        >{{ crumb.name }}</button>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
                {% if this.showingTrash %}
                    {{ icon('chev-right', 's14') }}
                    <b>Koš</b>
                {% endif %}
                {% set listed_count = this.showingTrash ? trash_count : gallery_assets|length %}
                <span class="cap">· {{ listed_count }} {{ listed_count == 1 ? 'obrázek' : (listed_count >= 2 and listed_count <= 4 ? 'obrázky' : 'obrázků') }}</span>
            </nav>

            {% if not this.showingTrash and gallery_assets is not empty %}
                {% set formats = gallery_assets|map(a => a.format)|reduce((carry, f) => f in carry ? carry : carry|merge([f]), []) %}
                <div class="gal-tools">
                    {% if formats|length > 1 %}
                        <div class="gal-chips" role="group" aria-label="Filtr podle formátu">
                            <button type="button" class="chip sm on" aria-pressed="true" data-gallery-filter-target="chip" data-format="" data-action="gallery-filter#pick">Vše <span class="n">{{ gallery_assets|length }}</span></button>
                            {% for format in formats %}
                                <button type="button" class="chip sm" aria-pressed="false" data-gallery-filter-target="chip" data-format="{{ format }}" data-action="gallery-filter#pick">{{ format }} <span class="n">{{ gallery_assets|filter(a => a.format == format)|length }}</span></button>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {# The two data-live-ignore islands carry stable ids: without
                       them the morph that adds the format chips (entering a
                       folder with mixed formats) failed to match the search
                       island and left a second search box behind.
                       Thumbnail size: the same slider + the same remembered size
                       (`wb-galsize`) in both modes — one preference per browser,
                       which the picker modal already applied before it had a
                       slider of its own. Only the unset default differs: the
                       modal's tighter grid starts at 150 px (gallery.css). #}
                    <label class="sz-ctl" id="gal-size-{{ modal ? 'modal' : 'page' }}" data-live-ignore title="Velikost náhledů">
                        {{ icon('image', 's12') }}
                        <input type="range" min="120" max="280" step="2" value="{{ modal ? 150 : 168 }}" aria-label="Velikost náhledů" data-gallery-filter-target="size" data-action="input->gallery-filter#resize">
                        {{ icon('image', 's18') }}
                    </label>
                    <label class="inp sm gal-search" id="gal-search-{{ modal ? 'modal' : 'page' }}" data-live-ignore>
                        {{ icon('search', 's14') }}
                        <input type="search" placeholder="Hledat podle názvu" aria-label="Hledat podle názvu" data-gallery-filter-target="search" data-action="input->gallery-filter#search">
                    </label>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if not this.showingTrash %}

        {# Folders #}
        {% if directories is not empty %}
            <div class="gal-folders">
                {% for directory in directories %}
                    {% if this.renamingDirectoryId == directory.id %}
                        <div class="gal-fold gal-fold-edit">
                            <label class="inp sm">
                                <input
                                    type="text"
                                    aria-label="Nový název složky"
                                    data-model="norender|renameValue"
                                    data-image-gallery-target="renameInput"
                                    value="{{ this.renameValue }}"
                                    autofocus
                                >
                            </label>
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="btn btn-primary icon xs"
                                title="Uložit název"
                                aria-label="Uložit název"
                                data-action="live#action"
                                data-live-action-param="renameDirectory"
                            >{{ icon('check', 's16') }}</button>
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="btn btn-ghost icon xs"
                                title="Zrušit"
                                aria-label="Zrušit"
                                data-action="live#action"
                                data-live-action-param="cancelRename"
                            >{{ icon('x', 's16') }}</button>
                        </div>
                    {% else %}
                        <div class="gal-fold folder-card">
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="gal-fold-b"
                                data-action="live#action"
                                data-live-action-param="openDirectory"
                                data-live-directoryid-param="{{ directory.id }}"
                                title="{{ directory.name }}"
                            >
                                <span class="gal-fi">{{ icon('folder') }}</span>
                                <span class="who"><b>{{ directory.name }}</b><span class="cap">Složka</span></span>
                            </button>
                            <div class="dropdown gal-fold-m">
                                <button
                                    type="button"
                                    class="btn btn-ghost icon xs"
                                    data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    aria-label="Možnosti složky {{ directory.name }}"
                                >{{ icon('more', 's16') }}</button>
                                <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
                                    <li>
                                        <button
                                            type="button"
                                            class="dropdown-item"
                                            data-action="live#action"
                                            data-live-action-param="startRename"
                                            data-live-directoryid-param="{{ directory.id }}"
                                        >{{ icon('edit', 's16') }}Přejmenovat</button>
                                    </li>
                                    <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                                    <li>
                                        <button
                                            type="button"
                                            class="dropdown-item text-danger"
                                            data-controller="confirm"
                                            data-confirm-message-value="Opravdu smazat složku „{{ directory.name }}“? Smazat lze jen prázdnou složku."
                                            data-action="confirm#confirm live#action"
                                            data-live-action-param="deleteDirectory"
                                            data-live-directoryid-param="{{ directory.id }}"
                                        >{{ icon('trash', 's16') }}Smazat</button>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {#
            Upload strip. The hidden CSRF `_token` and `directoryId` fields are
            OUTSIDE the data-live-ignore island so folder navigation keeps them
            fresh; the queue/progress island below is inside it so an in-flight
            batch survives every Live morph (each finished file triggers one).
        #}
        <form
            id="gallery-upload-form"
            class="gal-upload"
            data-controller="gallery-uploader"
            data-gallery-uploader-url-value="{{ this.uploadUrl() }}"
        >
            <input type="hidden" name="upload_project_file_form[_token]" value="{{ csrf_token('submit') }}">

            {# The currently-open folder the new upload lands in (empty = root). #}
            <input type="hidden" name="directoryId" value="{{ this.currentDirectoryId }}">

            <div
                class="gal-drop{{ modal ? ' gal-drop-compact' : '' }}"
                data-gallery-uploader-target="dropzone"
                data-action="
                    click->gallery-uploader#browse
                    keydown->gallery-uploader#keydown
                    dragover->gallery-uploader#dragOver
                    dragleave->gallery-uploader#dragLeave
                    drop->gallery-uploader#drop
                "
                role="button"
                tabindex="0"
                aria-label="Nahrát obrázky do složky {{ current_folder_label }}"
            >
                {{ icon('upload') }}
                <span><b>Přetáhněte obrázky sem</b> nebo <u>vyberte z počítače</u></span>
                <span class="cap">Nahraje se do: <b>{{ current_folder_label }}</b> · PNG, JPG, SVG, WebP · víc najednou · max. 10&nbsp;MB na soubor</span>
            </div>

            <input
                type="file"
                name="upload_project_file_form[file]"
                class="d-none"
                accept="image/*"
                multiple
                data-gallery-uploader-target="input"
                data-action="change->gallery-uploader#filesChosen"
            >

            {#
                Per-file progress rows (spinner → check / error). Populated by
                the controller; successful rows dissolve shortly after the grid
                picks the file up, failed rows stay dismissable.
            #}
            <div data-live-ignore>
                <div class="gal-queue" data-gallery-uploader-target="queue"></div>
            </div>
        </form>

        {% if directories is empty and gallery_assets is empty %}
            <p class="cap gal-empty-note">Tato složka je prázdná. Nahrajte obrázky přetažením výše nebo vytvořte podsložku.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {# Images. data-storage-path lets the image-gallery controller pulse
           freshly-uploaded thumbnails after the Live re-render. #}
        {% if gallery_assets is not empty %}
            <div class="gal-grid" data-gallery-filter-target="grid">
                {% for asset in gallery_assets %}
                    {% set renaming_file = this.renamingFileId == asset.id %}
                    <div class="gal-card gallery-asset{{ renaming_file ? ' is-renaming' : '' }}" data-storage-path="{{ asset.path }}" data-format="{{ asset.format }}" data-name="{{ (asset.name ?? '')|lower }}">
                        {% set thumb %}
                            <span class="gal-th">
                                <img crossorigin="anonymous" src="{{ asset.url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.gal-th').classList.add('is-broken')">
                                <span class="gal-th-miss" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon('image', 's24') }}</span>
                                <span class="gal-fmt">{{ asset.format }}</span>
                            </span>
                        {% endset %}
                        {% if renaming_file %}
                            {# Inline rename: only the name base is editable, the
                               extension stays as a fixed suffix. Enter submits the
                               form, Escape cancels. Rendered OUTSIDE the modal's
                               select button (a form can't live in a button). #}
                            {{ thumb }}
                            <form
                                class="gallery-asset__rename gal-rename"
                                data-action="live#action:prevent"
                                data-live-action-param="renameFile"
                            >
                                <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                                    <input
                                        type="text"
                                        class="form-control"
                                        maxlength="240"
                                        placeholder="Název obrázku"
                                        aria-label="Nový název obrázku"
                                        data-model="norender|fileRenameValue"
                                        data-image-gallery-target="renameInput"
                                        data-action="keydown.esc->live#action"
                                        data-live-action-param="cancelRename"
                                        value="{{ this.fileRenameValue }}"
                                    >
                                    {% if this.fileRenameExtension %}
                                        <span class="input-group-text">{{ this.fileRenameExtension }}</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="gal-rename-a">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" title="Uložit název">{{ icon('check', 's16') }}Uložit</button>
                                    <button
                                        type="button"
                                        class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
                                        title="Zrušit"
                                        data-action="live#action"
                                        data-live-action-param="cancelRename"
                                    >Zrušit</button>
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        {% elseif modal %}
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="gal-select gallery-asset__select"
                                data-action="click->image-gallery#select"
                                data-image-gallery-url-param="{{ asset.url }}"
                                data-image-gallery-path-param="{{ asset.path }}"
                                data-image-gallery-id-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                                data-image-gallery-name-param="{{ asset.name ?? '' }}"
                                data-image-gallery-width-param="{{ asset.width ?? '' }}"
                                data-image-gallery-height-param="{{ asset.height ?? '' }}"
                                title="{{ asset.tooltip }} · Nahráno {{ asset.uploadedAt }}"
                            >
                                {{ thumb }}
                                {{ include('_gallery_asset_caption.html.twig', {asset: asset}) }}
                            </button>
                        {% else %}
                            <div class="gal-body" title="{{ asset.tooltip }} · Nahráno {{ asset.uploadedAt }}">
                                {{ thumb }}
                                {# Standalone, the name itself is the rename handle too. #}
                                <button
                                    type="button"
                                    class="gal-name-b gallery-asset__rename-trigger"
                                    title="Přejmenovat"
                                    data-action="live#action"
                                    data-live-action-param="startFileRename"
                                    data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                                >{{ include('_gallery_asset_caption.html.twig', {asset: asset}) }}</button>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if not renaming_file %}
                            <div class="dropdown gal-more">
                                <button
                                    type="button"
                                    class="btn icon xs"
                                    data-bs-toggle="dropdown"
                                    aria-expanded="false"
                                    title="Možnosti obrázku"
                                    aria-label="Možnosti obrázku"
                                    onclick="event.stopPropagation();"
                                >{{ icon('more', 's16') }}</button>
                                <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
                                    <li>
                                        <button
                                            type="button"
                                            class="dropdown-item"
                                            data-action="live#action"
                                            data-live-action-param="startFileRename"
                                            data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                                        >{{ icon('edit', 's16') }}Přejmenovat</button>
                                    </li>
                                    {% if move_targets|length > 1 %}
                                        <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                                        <li><h6 class="dropdown-header">Přesunout do…</h6></li>
                                        {% for target in move_targets %}
                                            {% if target.id != this.currentDirectoryId %}
                                                <li>
                                                    <button
                                                        type="button"
                                                        class="dropdown-item"
                                                        data-action="live#action"
                                                        data-live-action-param="moveFile"
                                                        data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                                                        data-live-directoryid-param="{{ target.id }}"
                                                    >{{ icon('folder', 's16') }}{{ target.label }}</button>
                                                </li>
                                            {% endif %}
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <li><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                                    {# No confirm: the delete is reversible (Koš + 7-day
                                       retention); only the bin's "Smazat ihned" keeps a
                                       confirmation. #}
                                    <li>
                                        <button
                                            type="button"
                                            class="dropdown-item text-danger"
                                            title="Přesunout do koše"
                                            data-action="live#action"
                                            data-live-action-param="deleteFile"
                                            data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                                        >{{ icon('trash', 's16') }}Přesunout do koše</button>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <p class="cap gal-nomatch" data-gallery-filter-target="none" hidden>Žádný obrázek neodpovídá filtru.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% else %}
        {# ------------------------------------------------------------------
           Koš (trash bin): READ-ONLY. No upload, no folders, no select —
           images here can't be used in templates. Only Obnovit (back to the
           original folder, or the root when it's gone) and Smazat ihned
           (irreversible, keeps a confirm). Auto-purged after the retention
           window by app:gallery:purge-trash. #}
        {% set trashed_assets = this.trashedAssets() %}

        <div class="gal-note">
            {{ icon('info', 's16') }}
            <span>Obrázky v koši se po {{ this.trashRetentionDays() }} dnech trvale smažou a nelze je mezitím používat v šablonách ani editoru.</span>
        </div>

        {% if trashed_assets is empty %}
            <div class="empty gal-empty">
                <span class="ico-c">{{ icon('trash') }}</span>
                <h3>Koš je prázdný</h3>
            </div>
        {% else %}
            <div class="gal-grid">
                {% for asset in trashed_assets %}
                    <div class="gal-card gallery-asset gallery-asset--trashed" title="{{ asset.tooltip }} · Do koše {{ asset.deletedAt }}">
                        <span class="gal-th">
                            <img crossorigin="anonymous" src="{{ asset.url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.gal-th').classList.add('is-broken')">
                            <span class="gal-th-miss" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon('image', 's24') }}</span>
                            <span class="gal-fmt">{{ asset.format }}</span>
                        </span>
                        {{ include('_gallery_asset_caption.html.twig', {asset: asset}) }}
                        {# Templates still referencing the picture: the
                           nightly purge leaves such a file alone (the
                           countdown says so), only "Smazat ihned" — whose
                           confirm names them — removes it for good. #}
                        {% if asset.usedIn is not empty %}
                            <div class="gal-warn" data-gallery-used-in title="Šablony, které obrázek používají – při trvalém smazání o něj přijdou">
                                {{ icon('alert', 's14') }}
                                <span>Používá se v:
                                {% for site in asset.usedIn %}<a href="{{ path('template_variants', {'templateId': site.id}) }}">{{ site.name }}</a>{{ not loop.last ? ', ' }}{% endfor %}</span>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="gal-purge">{{ asset.purgeLabel }}</div>
                        <div class="gal-trash-a">
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="btn btn-tertiary btn-sm"
                                data-action="live#action"
                                data-live-action-param="restoreFile"
                                data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                            >{{ icon('undo', 's16') }}Obnovit</button>
                            {% set used_names = asset.usedIn|map(site => site.name)|join(', ') %}
                            <button
                                type="button"
                                class="btn btn-ghost-danger icon xs"
                                title="Smazat ihned (nevratné)"
                                aria-label="Smazat ihned"
                                data-controller="confirm"
                                data-confirm-message-value="{{ asset.usedIn is not empty
                                    ? 'Obrázek používá šablona: ' ~ used_names ~ '. Trvalým smazáním o něj přijde – v editoru zůstane jen prázdné místo a v exportu nic. Opravdu smazat ihned? Akce je nevratná.'
                                    : 'Trvale smazat tento obrázek? Akce je nevratná.' }}"
                                data-action="confirm#confirm live#action"
                                data-live-action-param="purgeFile"
                                data-live-fileid-param="{{ asset.id }}"
                            >{{ icon('trash', 's16') }}</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
